OL,3,GNEWSAMan who stole ambulance with
OL,4,Apatient inside jailed
OL,5,
OL,6,FA drug addict who stole an ambulance
OL,7,Fwith an elderly patient and "terrified"
OL,8,Fparamedic inside has been jailed for 21
OL,9,Fmonths.
OL,11,FMarshall Leese, a prolific user of
OL,12,Fmonkey dust, sped through red lights
OL,13,Fwhile being chased by police after
OL,14,Ftaking the ambulance from outside the
OL,15,FRoyal Stoke University Hospital in
OL,16,FStoke-on-Trent.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,359,350,200,160,0,100
